ri pull opentelemetri go 7427 md src pr 05 opentelemetri go 7443 md opentelemetri pull opentelemetri go 7443 md src pr 06 opentelemetri go 7474 md opentelemetri pull opentelemetri go 7474 md src note 01 entri 3389930076 md opentelemetri meet note entri 3389930076 md src note 02 entri 3389972183 md opentelemetri meet note entri 3389972183 md src note 03 entri 3390010099 md opentelemetri meet note entri 3390010099 md src note 04 entri 3479584781 md opentelemetri meet note entri 3479584781 md src note 07 entri 3581463689 md opentelemetri meet note entri 3581463689 md src mile 02 mileston 13145551 md opentelemetri mileston mileston 13145551 md src mile 03 mileston 13661613 md opentelemetri mileston mileston 13661613 md src rel 01 releas v1 39 0 md opentelemetri releas releas v1 39 0 md w 02 metric perform status in _ progress prioriti p0 owner dashpol project opentelemetri go last updat 2025 12 15\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"cf971b288a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"work-states/WS-02-metrics-performance.md\", \"id\": \"6b45ca2c003646a7\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.42972565446240074, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.30150190637485824, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7289144, \"dataset_name\": \"С2WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"work-states/WS-02-metrics-performance.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"cf971b288a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"work-states/WS-02-metrics-performance.md\", \"location\": \"work-states/WS-02-metrics-performance.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 4565, \"chunk_count\": 9, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:48:43\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:11:37\", \"token_count\": 4834, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"work-state\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- Improve performance of histogram `Record` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric` when min and max are disabled using `NoMinMax`. (#7306)\\n\\n- Improve error handling for dropped data during translation by using `prometheus.NewInvalidMetric` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/prometheus`. ⚠️ **Breaking Change:** Previously, these cases were only logged and scrapes succeeded. Now, when translation would drop data (e.g., invalid label/value), the exporter emits a `NewInvalidMetric`, and Prometheus scrapes **fail with HTTP 500** by default. To preserve the prior behavior (scrapes succeed while errors are logged), configure your Prometheus HTTP handler with: `promhttp.HandlerOpts{ ErrorHandling: promhttp.ContinueOnError }`. (#7363)\\n\\n- Replace fnv hash with xxhash in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/attribute` for better performance. (#7371)\\n\\n- The default `TranslationStrategy` in `go.opentelemetry.io/exporters/prometheus` is changed from `otlptranslator.NoUTF8EscapingWithSuffixes` to `otlptranslator.UnderscoreEscapingWithSuffixes`. (#7421)\\n\\n- Improve performance of concurrent measurements in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric`. (#7427)\\n\\n- Include W3C TraceFlags (bits 0–7) in the OTLP `Span.Flags` field in `go.opentelemetry.io/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracehttp` and `go.opentelemetry.io/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracegrpc`. (#7438)\\n\\n- The `ErrorType` function in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.37.0` now handles custom error types.\\n\\n  If an error implements an `ErrorType() string` method, the return value of that method will be used as the error type. (#7442)\\n\\n### Fixed\\n\\n- Fix `WithInstrumentationAttributes` options in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace`, `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/metric`, and `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/log` to properly merge attributes when passed multiple times instead of replacing them. Attributes with duplicate keys will use the last value passed. (#7300)\\n\\n- The equality of `attribute.Set` when using the `Equal` method is not affected by the user overriding the empty set pointed to by `attribute.EmptySet` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/attribute`. (#7357)\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"improv perform of histogram record in go opentelemetri io otel sdk metric when min and max are disabl use nominmax 7306 improv error handl for drop data dure translat by use prometheus newinvalidmetr in go opentelemetri io otel export prometheus break chang previous these case were onli log and scrape succeed now when translat would drop data e g invalid label valu the export emit a newinvalidmetr and prometheus scrape fail with http 500 by default to preserv the prior behavior scrape succeed while error are log configur your prometheus http handler with promhttp handleropt errorhandl promhttp continueonerror 7363 replac fnv hash with xxhash in go opentelemetri io otel attribut for better perform 7371 the default translationstrategi in go opentelemetri io export prometheus is chang from otlptransl noutf8escapingwithsuffixes to otlptransl underscoreescapingwithsuffix 7421 improv perform of concurr measur in go opentelemetri io otel sdk metric 7427 includ w3c traceflag bit 0 7 in the otlp span flag field in go opentelemetri io export otlp otlptrac otlptracehttp and go opentelemetri io export otlp otlptrac otlptracegrpc 7438 the errortyp function in go opentelemetri io otel semconv v1 37 0 now handl custom error type if an error implement an errortyp string method the return valu of that method will be use a the error type 7442 fix fix withinstrumentationattribut option in go opentelemetri io otel trace go opentelemetri io otel metric and go opentelemetri io otel log to proper merg attribut when pass multipl time instead of replac them attribut with duplic key will use the last valu pass 7300 the equal of attribut set when use the equal method is not affect by the user overrid the empti set point to by attribut emptyset in go opentelemetri io otel attribut 7357\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"0760475a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"id\": \"f831c7a24c72ff15\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.4290597296883961, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.2713988138405659, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7969352, \"dataset_name\": \"С2WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"0760475a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 52878, \"chunk_count\": 30, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:50:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:10:48\", \"token_count\": 15994, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}], \"pagination\": {\"page\": 1, \"page_size\": 10, \"total_chunks\": 70, \"total_pages\": 7}, \"query_info\": {\"question\": \"OpenTelemetry Go v1.39.0 custom temporality selector configuration supported selector API release\", \"similarity_threshold\": 0.2, \"vector_weight\": 0.3, \"keyword_search\": false, \"dataset_count\": 1}}"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
