back about standard prefer prometheus export migrat status implement complet need deprec decis discuss need to decid on deprec exist configur option decis tyler support deprec befor mark a stabl next step handl in next mileston error handl for prometheus status pr readi for review wait for convers resolut action david to review and potenti merg high mutex content in metric sum status resolv via pr 7427 action close issu 2 optim work discuss david s current work implement lockless exponenti histogram fun and challeng optim project build on previous optim pr pr review need pr 7474 exemplar reservoir optim approv by tyler need second approv pr 7443 histogram optim need review ha race condit issu identifi technic discuss on pr 7443 tyler identifi potenti race condit in min max track with isset flag\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"073509be8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3390010099.md\", \"id\": \"f02ac333247e22c0\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.4017253362188905, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.2692047231698436, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7109401, \"dataset_name\": \"С2WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3390010099.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"073509be8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3390010099.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3390010099.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 3423, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:50:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:11:26\", \"token_count\": 796, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-01]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2025-10-10\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3389930076  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-10-10T12:53:12Z · **Updated**: 2025-10-10T12:54:14Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-09-25\\n\\n**Attendees:**\\n\\n- Tyler Yahn.\\n\\n- Bryan Boreham.\\n\\n- David Ashpole (dashpole).\\n\\n- Owen Williams.\\n\\n- Robert Pająk.\\n\\n## Announcements\\n\\n- go.opentelemetry.io certificate incident:\\n\\n  - Website experienced downtime due to a certificate issuance problem.\\n\\n  - Issue has been remediated; if problems persist, open an issue or ask in Slack.\\n\\n  - A post-mortem will be published to cover root cause and the broader incident.\\n\\n  - Apologies for the disruption; steps will be taken to prevent recurrence.\\n\\n- Events:\\n\\n  - KubeCon EU likely in Amsterdam next year; some attendees considering talks.\\n\\n  - Talk idea noted: “Parsing Protobuf at gigabytes per second — and other fantasies.”\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-01]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2025-10-10\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3389930076  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-10-10T12:53:12Z · **Updated**: 2025-10-10T12:54:14Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-09-25\\n\\n**Attendees:**\\n\\n- Tyler Yahn.\\n\\n- Bryan Boreham.\\n\\n- David Ashpole (dashpole).\\n\\n- Owen Williams.\\n\\n- Robert Pająk.\\n\\n## Milestone Check-in\\n\\n- Why does cardinality limit add performance overhead to metric measurements?\\n\\n  - Status: Needs benchmarking to assess/confirm.\\n\\n  - Assignee: David Ashpole volunteered.\\n\\n  - Note: If it takes longer than expected, may unassign and remove from milestone.\\n\\n- Expose temporality selector functions:\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src note 01 meet note opentelemetri go sig 2025 1010 canon url http github com open telemetri open